=\"#/quest/the-djinn-war-marid-faction\">The Djinn War - Marid Faction</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-mummys-curse-world-change\">The Mummy's Curse World Change</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-travelling-trader-quest\">The Travelling Trader Quest</a></li></ul></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">7.3<br/>August 11, 2004</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Links</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Streets</td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Buildings</td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Towns</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">More images</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map2\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ankrahmun\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"100\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ankrahmun_5a5d59.png\" width=\"125\"/></span></p><p><br/> </p><p><br/> </p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The city of <b>Ankrahmun</b> is located on the southern portion of the island of <a href=\"#/wiki/Darama\">Darama</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33146,32816,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33146, 32816, 7)</a>. It is separated from <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a> to the north by a vast desert and mountains. It is completely surrounded by desert on three sides, to the south is the sea.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Surroundings\">Surroundings</span></h3>\n<p>The surrounding land holds little life on the surface, however many creatures such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Larva\">larvas</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Scarab\">scarabs</a> make their nests underground. <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a> have settled in the mountains to the west of the city. It is also rumored that <a href=\"#/wiki/Djinn\">djinns</a> have built magnificent towers hidden in the mountains. Archaeological digs have been conducted at several key <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun%20Tombs\">tomb</a> sites around Ankrahmun and many horrendous creatures have been found on these enormous <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun%20Tombs\">tombs</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-The_City\">The City</span></h3>\n<p>The city is composed of mostly pyramids, previously used to house the dead, these structures now serve as homes and shops. Its inhabitants follow the leadership of their pharaoh and honor the dead, as well as the <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">living dead</a>. The city has a ship at the southern port as well as many shops and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">depot</a>. Some time ago, it was a very popular town for Player Killers because you were able to stair-hop the pyramids, thus making you almost invulnerable. Currently all the pyramids are protection zones, which makes this city one of the safest in Tibia.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"w-Ankrahmun_NPCs_.2835_NPCs.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Ankrahmun_NPCs_(35_NPCs)\">Ankrahmun NPCs (35 NPCs)</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Name\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>Job\n</th>\n<th>Buy/Sell\n</th>\n<th>Location\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Agostina\">Agostina</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"npc-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Agostina\"><img alt=\"Agostina\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Agostina_4dd2fd.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Assistant<br/>Magic Shopkeeper<br/>Tibia Drome\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">The <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ankrahmun</strong> <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibiadrome\">Tibiadrome</a>; access via <a href=\"#/wiki/Mystic%20Flame\">Mystic Flame</a> south of depot.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ahmet\">Ahmet</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"npc-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ahmet\"><img alt=\"Ahmet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ahmet_92594b.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Equipment Shopkeeper\n</td>\n<td><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\">In <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Ankrahmun</strong>, north of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Depot\">Depot</a>, up one level.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Alesar\">Alesar</a>\n</td>\n<td class=\"npc-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Alesar\"><img alt=\"Alesar\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Alesar_d951cd.gif\" width=\"67\"/></a></span>\n</t